  <name>Paint</name>
  <summary>Draw and edit pictures in the style of Windows 11 Paint</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      A clone of Windows 11 Paint for Linux: pencil, brushes, shapes, text, fill, color picker,
      selections with free rotation, crop, resize and skew, layers, background removal, rulers,
      gridlines and light and dark themes.
    </p>
    <p>Not affiliated with or endorsed by Microsoft.</p>
  </description>
  <developer id="io.github.addition-official">
